    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράνυμφ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bridegroom's friend</i> or
				<i>best man</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.40
			</span></i> ; 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρωρός</span>
			, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				2076.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem.,
				<i>bridesmaid</i>, one of the <i>dramatis personae</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
					<u>EM</u>145.31</span></i>, Moer.<i><span class="en">
				p.269P.
			</span></i></div>
